<title>POLAND: OLAWA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>OLAWA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.35 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.57 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.48 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Sales		    4.26 vs   3.67</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.01 vs   0.94</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.67 vs   1.61</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.37 vs   1.40</p>
<p> Sales		   13.75 vs  11.20</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish non-ferrous metals smelter is</p>
<p>Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
